{"1941370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dancin' Divas", "steam_appid": 1941370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/9738170f020f11186fd62290db2d9863.avif?t=1771212927\" width=512 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A robbery has taken place! Four Diva's from around the world are showcasing their treasures at  the local lounge but things have gone south. It's time to fight back! </strong> <br><br><strong>Pick your Diva or get some friends together and go after the the baddies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d62fd7adb68fb6e8dd5054f93351ca41.poster.avif?t=1771212927\" width=786 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d62fd7adb68fb6e8dd5054f93351ca41.webm?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d62fd7adb68fb6e8dd5054f93351ca41.mp4?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/2fece2be9266ca4c3a51491f91758a63.avif?t=1771212927\" width=512 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic arcade side scrolling beat em up with some sexy character design and radical gameplay! For players who love to button mash and those out to get combos, Dancin Diva's is a love letter to games like Konami's Simpsons Arcade and Streets of Rage. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/b7cc0a3bd5b26659df2f5c455edf21e8.poster.avif?t=1771212927\" width=786 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/b7cc0a3bd5b26659df2f5c455edf21e8.webm?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/b7cc0a3bd5b26659df2f5c455edf21e8.mp4?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you are not bashing bad guys you can play mini games and try unique styles of gameplay be it breaking boards or speedboat mayhem. There is no time to be bored in the world of Dancin Diva's. </strong>  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/2e27db3ef7356a33d88500eaac60d1f7.poster.avif?t=1771212927\" width=786 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/2e27db3ef7356a33d88500eaac60d1f7.webm?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/2e27db3ef7356a33d88500eaac60d1f7.mp4?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <br> <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/b6f1679ee7f8904135c49f3ea0dda8c3.avif?t=1771212927\" width=512 height=104 /></span><strong> </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Viva </strong> - The one in blue with the most balanced skills and the power of lightning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/712fb39144681f904daf71e6b14cc43f.avif?t=1771212927\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hina</strong> - In the red, she goes for long range attacks and isn't afraid to play with fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d2003f2571fd705e54f75b15678d8f61.avif?t=1771212927\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bahati </strong> - The one in yellow can use their large size and perform quite the wrestling suplexes to break the earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/18083c716809d0110f6558c2cef14925.avif?t=1771212927\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sofia</strong> - The shortest, this green one is quick with their moves and agility and fly like the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/1cf623551bbd58aaaeafd5287c64507b.avif?t=1771212927\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/258864664e478e523a73370fa0575b82.avif?t=1771212927\" width=512 height=104 /></span><strong> </strong> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Play over 16 show stopping levels across the globe! </strong></i> <br>  <br><i>- <strong>Many level routes! Choose paths for multiple playthroughs! </strong></i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Dozens of combos and hundreds of and animated frame animations inspired by Pizza Tower &amp; AntonBlast!  </strong> </i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Minigame Mayhem! Test your Might or drive to victory with many types of gameplay! </strong></i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- In game shop with unlocks, cheats, weapons and more!  </strong> </i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Unlock over 70 gallery pics of the Divas. Gawk at the many ladies of Dancin Divas! </strong> </i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Multiplayer mode, bring your best Divas in 4 player mode! </strong></i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Voices from the talented MizzPeachy, Mimi Hung, Flirty Fawn, Cinder &amp; SedThePanda! </strong> </i> <br>  <br><i><strong>- Classic Midi bop soundtrack by Evader Music &amp; Jonorsi</strong></i>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/5ca3c6d2b0a7e34e35c9d21637ef4370.poster.avif?t=1771212927\" width=786 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/5ca3c6d2b0a7e34e35c9d21637ef4370.webm?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/5ca3c6d2b0a7e34e35c9d21637ef4370.mp4?t=1771212927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/9738170f020f11186fd62290db2d9863.avif?t=1771212927\" width=512 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A robbery has taken place! Four Diva's from around the world are showcasing their treasures at  the local lounge but things have gone south. It's time to fight back! </strong> <br><br><strong>Pick your Diva or get some friends together and go after the the baddies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi